      "name": "verify_ownership",
      "description": "Two-phase ownership verification. Phase 1 (start): call with phase=start to get a token and instructions — then the developer must deploy the token to their agent (response header, .well-known file, or DID endpoint). Phase 2 (verify): after deployment, call with phase=verify to confirm. Do not call verify immediately after start; wait for the user to confirm the token is deployed. Requires KYNVER_API_KEY.",
